FYI: I've migrated CVS repositories to Subversion using "tailor" and was
pretty happy with the result. I can't compare them to cvs2svn though.
Tailor can also be used to sync multiple SCM tools afaik, but I've never
used it beyond a one-time migration. I think it's made by the Darcs
people, but it supports at least 4-5 different SCMs.

